WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520
Thank you very much today

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:02,880
Don't dig blindly this time

3
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,440
Check the terrain first and then paint, right?

4
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:07,940
I've known for a long time that Brother Mouchuan wouldn't be able to survive after last night ended like this.

5
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,220
Firewood available for burning around here

6
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:10,940
We and that person have already picked up the golden light.

7
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:13,620
Even the roots of the trees are gone before we continue to burn our fire.

8
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:15,940
I can't last a few days, right? The fairy is out of firewood.

9
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:17,140
How warm is this igloo?

10
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,140
It's also an ice cave

11
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,660
The long winter ahead

12
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:22,900
How can I survive this day? I have already expected this day.

13
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:25,940
What really makes people survive is that the matches are gone

14
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,420
Then change it to something that can burn

15
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:29,180
These poisonous stones sent by Qian Degui

16
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,740
That's what I really use

17
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,620
Shi Mei can't just be burned before touching it.

18
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:38,180
I need to get something first, a stone, and follow me to dig out the mud.

19
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:40,700
Dig, dig, Bamuchuan brother

20
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:41,780
What we are short of is firewood.

21
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:42,740
Why are you digging in the mud?

22
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,620
Mud can burn you

23
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:46,580
Mud can burn fire

24
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:49,020
It doesn’t matter if the stone can burn

25
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,820
This mud can be burned no matter what
